coreo — behaviour scripts to motion clips for Jumper
Copyright 2026 Zymbiotek

This product includes material derived from KingKong Robotics' Jumper
(https://github.com/KingKongRobotics/jumper, Apache-2.0):
  - robot.json: joint names, HOME pose and joint ranges exported from its MJCF;
  - posturas/base.toml: frames of its committed gesture clips (hello, bow, paw, salute).
The bridge scripts in puente/ import Jumper's own tools at run time; no code is copied.
